{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5fec762079b30a9b9f6f0bac0f40b3294e46aae513a33030d88648b3cca0ec4d", "ja": "（可憐から『更衣室に来てほしい』と連絡があった。\n衣装合わせの予定はなかったと思うけど……？）", "zh": "（可怜联系我，说希望我去更衣室。应该没有安排试衣才对，可是……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "7e6571f20784c52e36406414d68d204cf7d396e8b4ec28fdfa0936356d563d5b", "ja": "うん……いい感じ、かな。これなら、自信を持って\n{$P$}さんの前にも……。", "zh": "嗯……感觉还不错吧。这样一来，就能自信地站在\n{$P$}先生面前了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2d475235085e46e61546b2fb884e1f160aa10e31de69ec29af25e18ca7783f7b", "ja": "いたいた。お疲れ様、可憐。", "zh": "原来在这里。辛苦了，可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "a7f900f9551cac4c84696f679fbc526e3bd6ea8149507931422b9f01792545ae", "ja": "ひゃぁ！　あ、あっ、{$P$}さん\n……っ。おお、お仕事はもう大丈夫ですか……？", "zh": "呀！啊、啊，{$P$}先生……！工、工作已经告一段落了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a7a3dc6c16eea17f1db0cb2c7efce7333e29889a560452d9edf76c287cd984b0", "ja": "ああ、ちょうど一段落したところだ。\nそれより急に連絡がきたから驚いたよ。", "zh": "啊，正好忙完一段落。\n不过突然收到你的联系，我也吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "1e3e558bb77790e6f591fff7878cbf10a18b49362ff1d1d820b8511c70eb869a", "ja": "い、忙しい時にすみません……。けど、どうしても\n{$P$}さんに見てほしくて……。", "zh": "在、在您正忙的时候打扰真对不起……。但是，我无论如何\n都想让{$P$}先生看看……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "ec3fb78ee39a16ebbe9894a906bc655d02203c64a59ef39d7a0da873ea9cb586", "ja": "そ、その……今日の私のコーデ、どう思いますか！？", "zh": "那、那个……您觉得我今天这身搭配怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ec244d97984398f120f25fad4aad515cab4e96784d552e5f23ae2e4f80ca41b4", "ja": "えっ？　そうだな……\n可憐によく似合ってて、可愛いと思うよ。", "zh": "诶？这个嘛……\n我觉得很适合可怜，很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "1da7c81dd3e3bd019c53781f75763a2a38cfbd1b4686e74b5a9c5292aea4e7da", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか……？\nお世辞とかじゃなくて……。", "zh": "真、真的吗……？\n不是在说客套话吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8f50990604d730d911cf73397fc278bfb3f14e6f26e3f24b9299289066fb2f18", "ja": "もちろん。普段より落ち着いてるからか、\n歳相応な雰囲気がして、ちょっと新鮮だよ。", "zh": "当然。可能是因为比平时沉稳一些，看起来很有符合年龄的感觉，让人觉得有点新鲜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "f0191264e96bdf690648d5454086d62633c023e98a5f386c11397270b9626928", "ja": "よ、よかったぁ……。\nちょっと雰囲気を変えてみようかなって思って……。", "zh": "太、太好了……。\n我想着要不要稍微改变一下感觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "c33439b05ca461d84a0ed762b4fd2db707072ebc6f9477bbbde88b779dee635c", "ja": "で、でも。いざ変えてみたら、\n急に不安になってしまって……。", "zh": "但是、但是……真的改变之后，突然就感到不安了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e581606f921e97a6dd9b620c383283665091a1d329277b0f2dbd7eedd1b6766a", "ja": "可憐……。\nそれで、俺に連絡を？", "zh": "可怜……。\n所以才联系我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "14a2e5c733acf828114e60d62869b915ceb46288cfb8ffe9d24b05af79f1a1f2", "ja": "そ、それもありますけど……。一番に\n{$P$}さんに、見て欲しくて……。", "zh": "确、确实也有这个原因，不过……最想让\n{$P$}先生先看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f4475d636acbf5121e53bf05004d3282aadf23f4f87aa9356dabcbb8c1ccdc6e", "ja": "俺に？", "zh": "想让我看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "956f18cb5b1c66c898a92f4d4e14960435d3569d5097a1abe816021ad605a390", "ja": "は、はい……。い、いつもは、\n地味に見られないような服を選ぶんですけど……。", "zh": "是、是的……我、我平时会选择不显得朴素的衣服，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "e89eb3c422d2182f6215b1126efc2593f2e87ac7f0542c40b516514419567218", "ja": "その……さ、最近は少しずつ……\nじ、自信を持てるようになってきた、かなって……。", "zh": "那个……最、最近我好像也渐渐……变得有自信了一点……吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "23585855703ffd771ee1ff9e8f334482ec66d29c74e09ef5274998171a5a3df9", "ja": "だから、お、思い切って……いつもより、\nおとなしめの服と髪型にしてみたんです……！", "zh": "所以，我、我就鼓起勇气……试着穿了比平时更朴素一些的衣服，也换了发型……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1018_p", "source_sha256": "35e3d953e2174bbd85b41d08e4f86e448e2193b0ee38079ccd560d7e290f621e", "ja": "そうか。少しでも自分を変えようとして……。\nじゃあその服は、可憐の成長の証だな！", "zh": "这样啊。你在努力哪怕只改变一点自己……那么，这身打扮就是可怜成长的证明了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "25d0023916f058c9014f870e92ab7bd800ac43c23fd1cb747cc0e406e29042bc", "ja": "は、はい……！　私が自信を持てるようになったのは\n{$P$}さんのおかげですから……。", "zh": "是、是的……！我能变得自信起来，都是多亏了{$P$}先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1020_p", "source_sha256": "11d2d77e3d6b823135b07160685036d395a424eb015172658c97949e68e55907", "ja": "ははっ。そう言ってくれるのは嬉しいけど、\n自分を変えられるよう努力してるのは可憐だ。", "zh": "哈哈。你这么说我很开心，不过，努力改变自己的可是可怜啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c7260b5b71c23471d3d7198058a1e33399a014ab890fdaccacbebeb571e23e5a", "ja": "だから改めて……。\n今日のコーデ、すごく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "所以再认真说一次……  \n你今天的搭配真的很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0404_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "95791c30b67d3f440073e6c563b204300d6775306a9f9a3889bfa41351e7d289", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。褒めてもらえて\nまた少し、自信がついたかも……なんて。てへへ♪", "zh": "啊，谢谢你……能得到夸奖，\n感觉自己又多了一点自信……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
